00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:31.500
<b>After beating Muozinel and traveling for four days,</b>

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:34.170
<b>Tigre and the Silver Meteor Stormtroops hid in Fort Perche.</b>

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:37.510
<b>This was made possible</b>

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:41.550
<b>thanks to their new alliance with Emile of the Order of Perche.</b>

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:46.680
<b>You should have just stayed in Zhcted,</b>

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:49.100
<b>though maybe you were too worried about your men for that.</b>

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:52.110
<b>Thank you for your concern,</b>

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:54.610
<b>but the men under me are quite capable.</b>

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:59.030
<b>And what about you?
Haven't gotten homesick by now?</b>

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:00.030
<b>My, my,</b>

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:04.810
<b>you must've really grown up to be concerned about me, Eleonora.</b>

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:08.290
<b>Big words for someone who was late to a critical battle.</b>

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:10.830
<b>It's true.</b>

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:13.790
<b>I definitely didn't get back in time.</b>

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:19.590
<b>Thank you for your help, Ludmila.</b>

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:23.660
<b>But now I'm back!</b>

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:26.100
<b>You're no longer needed here!</b>

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:29.100
<b>Head back to Olmütz immediately!</b>

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:35.110
<b>Our king gave me orders to keep an eye on you.</b>

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.360
<b>Besides, Tigre still owes me.</b>

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:49.950
<b>Something's off.</b>

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:51.040
<b>What is it?</b>

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:53.750
<b>I'm sure you are merely tired.</b>

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:55.540
<b>As commanding officer,</b>

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:59.130
<b>your duties and responsibilities increase with every victory.</b>

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.300
<b>That's true.</b>

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:04.760
<b>Anyway, why are we meeting this early in the morning?</b>

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:08.560
<b>Well, we're here because of His Highness, the prince.</b>

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:10.380
<b>Huh? His Highness?</b>

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:12.520
<b>Wasn't he killed in the battle of Dinant?</b>

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:15.650
<b>Rumor has it that someone in 
this camp is his spitting image.</b>

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:18.570
<b>You don't happen to know whom the rumors are about, do you?</b>

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:21.240
<b>Who could that be?</b>

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.860
<b>Young Lord, please excuse the interruption.</b>

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:25.160
<b>What is it, Bertrand?</b>

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:29.660
<b>A young lady named Regin wishes to see you.</b>

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:31.410
<b>Regin?</b>

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:41.090
<b>You look a lot better now.</b>

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:45.720
<b>Um, there's something we have to speak about.</b>

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:49.220
<b>Uh...</b>

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:52.980
<b>Don't worry about them. 
Go ahead and tell me.</b>

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:56.980
<b>Very well.</b>

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:00.400
<b>I am...</b>

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:04.650
<b>Until recently I was known under the name Regnas.</b>

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:14.000
<b>Or to be precise, Regnas Estelle Loire Bastien de Charles.</b>

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.460
<b>My word, I've never heard a name longer than Count Tigre's.</b>

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:21.460
<b>Miss Regin, can you prove what you just said?</b>

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:24.880
<b>Sir Tigrevurmud,</b>

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:28.080
<b>we met six years ago, at Vincennes.</b>

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:29.550
<b>Do you remember?</b>

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:32.560
<b>Vincennes...</b>

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:36.690
<b>I slipped out of the hunting festival by myself,</b>

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:39.310
<b>and then ran into you, who had done the same.</b>

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:50.120
<b>Don't tell anyone.</b>

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:55.410
<b>That was the first time I'd ever eaten 
something fresh off the roast and still hot.</b>

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:57.830
<b>Wow, this is good.</b>

00:05:58.530 --> 00:05:59.830
<b>You're...</b>

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:03.550
<b>I mean, are you really His Highness?</b>

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:17.310
<b>Everything okay?</b>

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:20.230
<b>Ugh, sorry for the trouble.</b>

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.270
<b>Prince Regnas?</b>

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:25.320
<b>Didn't you kill him at Dinant?</b>

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:29.030
<b>How should I know? It's not like anyone brought back his head.</b>

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:32.240
<b>Don't worry.</b>

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:36.040
<b>You can show her the same level of trust you show me.</b>

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:39.000
<b>I have full confidence in Elen.</b>

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:46.460
<b>An assassin used the confusion caused by the night raid to attack me.</b>

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:51.260
<b>And it doesn't take much to be passed off as having fallen in battle.</b>

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:55.510
<b>Anyway, why were you posing as a boy in the first place?</b>

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:57.810
<b>For both my mother and myself.</b>

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:03.320
<b>In Brune, a queen who can't bear a boy is worth nothing.</b>

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:07.530
<b>What's more, the odds of a woman succeeding to the throne are extremely low.</b>

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.900
<b>So you played the part of the prince?</b>

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.780
<b>Talk about foolhardy.</b>

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:15.490
<b>I totally agree. 
It might've been dandy at the start,</b>

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:18.660
<b>but what would you have done if
you'd developed breasts like Lim's?</b>

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:26.190
<b>What now, Tigre?</b>

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:27.050
<b>Huh?</b>

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:29.800
<b>Frankly, she'll be in the way.</b>

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:41.020
<b>"The prince actually survived,</b>

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:45.060
<b>but Thenardier and Ganelon tried to kill him."</b>

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:46.570
<b>Let's suppose we announce that.</b>

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:51.530
<b>Once the people find out the "prince"
is actually a girl, we'll lose their trust...</b>

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.120
<b>and would've played into our enemy's hands.</b>

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.620
<b>I understand what you're saying.</b>

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.250
<b>If I could see His Royal Majesty...</b>

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:02.080
<b>His Majesty is...</b>

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.880
<b>What about my father?</b>

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.420
<b>His mind is troubled.</b>

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:19.770
<b>Regin, why'd you open up to me?</b>

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:21.730
<b>Why'd you trust me?</b>

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:30.230
<b>Because you... don't have any ulterior motives.</b>

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:31.360
<b>What?</b>

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:38.370
<b>You were branded a traitor and stood nothing
to gain by helping the people of the southlands.</b>

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:42.040
<b>Yet you desperately fought for them.</b>

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:47.880
<b>What's more... when you granted
my request, you were really gentle.</b>

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:51.510
<b>Your request?</b>

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:53.880
<b>The other day...</b>

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:57.010
<b>I asked him to give me a bath.</b>

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:03.000
<b>Can you do me a favor?</b>

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:06.100
<b>Could you help me...</b>

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:10.650
<b>take a bath?</b>

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:11.650
<b>Huh?</b>

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:27.920
<b>You're playing it fast and loose, aren't you?</b>

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:34.050
<b>What would you have done if he'd jumped you? 
Would you have left without a word?</b>

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:36.550
<b>I know it was sneaky,</b>

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:41.560
<b>but I couldn't think of any other way to test him.</b>

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:45.390
<b>Regin, do you... well...</b>

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:50.970
<b>can you prove that your father's the king?</b>

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:55.570
<b>Lutetia.</b>

00:09:56.670 --> 00:09:59.200
<b>Duke Ganelon's territory?</b>

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:02.080
<b>Lutetia's capital of Artesium...</b>

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:04.040
<b>has a door under it.</b>

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:08.210
<b>Only members of the royal family know how to open it.</b>

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:12.130
<b>Brune's prime minister, Badouin, knows this well.</b>

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:21.390
<b>Let's go. To Artesium.</b>

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:28.940
<b>Thank you for waiting so long, Your Highness.</b>

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:32.900
<b>It looks like you've gotten me more than I was expecting.</b>

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:43.700
<b>What's with those chains?</b>

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:46.870
<b>I had them forge something special.</b>

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:51.830
<b>These dragons should be able to tear through a war maiden or ten without problems.</b>

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.420
<b>Well done.</b>

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:00.630
<b>That Thenardier...</b>

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:02.930
<b>He's gotten five new dragons, has he?</b>

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:06.520
<b>The army I sent to the capital will be wiped out.</b>

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:10.690
<b>But then there's Tigrevurmud Vorn...</b>

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:12.100
<b>Intriguing.</b>

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:18.320
<b>What am I to make of this situation?</b>

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:20.150
<b>The bow has been found.</b>

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:24.330
<b>The Black Knight Roland, 
wielder of Durandal, has been killed.</b>

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:29.660
<b>Things are progressing well. 
The king is... irrelevant.</b>

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:33.290
<b>Even if his mind recovers, the poison will do its work.</b>

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:36.090
<b>There's nothing more for me to do here.</b>

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:41.220
<b>Now Vorn will head to Artesium to prove Regin's lineage.</b>

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:46.010
<b>Thenardier will come as well to prevent that from happening.</b>

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:47.100
<b>Good...</b>

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:52.140
<b>I'll leave a parting gift for the winner in Artesium.</b>

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:54.610
<b>I know, I'll set something up underground.</b>

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:58.980
<b>I'll prepare a fitting stage for them.</b>

