<b>Here it comes!</b>

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:06.990
<b>Help us!</b>

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:19.210
<b>Ganelon's army is no more.</b>

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:24.720
<b>Count Vorn's forces appear to be headed for Artesium.</b>

00:12:25.150 --> 00:12:28.970
<b>Word is that Princess Regin is with him.</b>

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:33.690
<b>I see. They're going to the cave shrine.</b>

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:37.230
<b>Regin, I'll bury you along with Vorn.</b>

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:40.230
<b>As an emissary, you say?</b>

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:43.990
<b>Eleonora started this war half a year ago.</b>

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:47.490
<b>She should ready herself to withdraw if required.</b>

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:52.250
<b>I am asking <i>you</i> to go since you already visited Brune for me once.</b>

00:12:52.610 --> 00:12:54.500
<b>Do you understand, Sofya?</b>

00:12:56.630 --> 00:13:00.140
<b>I humbly accept this appointment.</b>

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:05.130
<b><i>Emissary to the capital of Brune...</i></b>

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:10.090
<b><i>His Majesty feels that the war is coming to a close.</i></b>

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:14.890
<b>My, if it isn't Sofya Obertas.</b>

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:16.150
<b>Valentina...</b>

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:19.360
<b>It's been a long time, Sofya.</b>

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:23.900
<b>Yes, it has. What brings you to the palace?</b>

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:29.410
<b>Limiting myself to my own territories left me starved for information.</b>

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:35.910
<b>So I came here, even though all the hustle and bustle at the royal capital and palace tires me out.</b>

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:37.540
<b>Bye now.</b>

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:53.930
<b>Artesium has burned down? 
What do you mean?</b>

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:59.190
<b>Duke Ganelon ordered his own capital torched before going missing.</b>

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:01.070
<b>Are we sure the reports are accurate?</b>

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:01.820
<b>Yes.</b>

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.570
<b>And what is Thenardier doing?</b>

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:06.280
<b>He has defeated Duke Ganelon's army,</b>

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:08.570
<b>and is now slowly marching northward.</b>

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:13.330
<b>Your Highness, there will be no change in plans.</b>

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:16.080
<b>We'll head to Artesium anyway.</b>

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:19.080
<b>To obtain proof of Regin's identity,</b>

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:22.960
<b>the Silver Meteor Stormtroops head toward Artesium.</b>

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:27.270
<b>On their way, they face off against
Thenardier's army on the Villecresnes Plains.</b>

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:33.610
<b>Their army of twenty thousand clashes with Thenardier's twenty-four thousand.</b>

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:41.230
<b>While the two central columns are locked in battle,</b>

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:44.170
<b>Elen and Mila push forward together on the right flank.</b>

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:49.360
<b>Their goal is to break through Thenardier's left flank and close in on the dragons.</b>

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:56.310
<b>Ley Admos!</b>

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.540
<b>Cielo Zam Kafa!</b>

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:25.900
<b>Talk about a bad sign.</b>

00:15:26.870 --> 00:15:28.900
<b>So that's the power of war maidens, is it?</b>

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:34.200
<b>I want them surrounded the moment they finish off the dragons. Tear them apart!</b>

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.910
<b>Doesn't matter if it costs us six thousand soldiers!</b>

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.120
<b>Ley Admos!</b>

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:42.250
<b>What?!</b>

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:45.670
<b>Verni!</b>

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:50.920
<b><i>It's too hard!</i></b>

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:55.800
<b>Cielo Zam Kafa!</b>

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:11.610
<b>Eleonora!</b>

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:15.570
<b>That's what happens when you freeze up in battle.</b>

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:16.700
<b>Shut it!</b>

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:21.460
<b>Cielo Zam Kafa!</b>

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:25.830
<b>Stop them dead in their tracks!</b>

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:29.000
<b>There's nothing to be gained from giving ground.</b>

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:32.170
<b>What's worse, if we retreat we'll lose everything!</b>

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:35.340
<b>Remember why you're all here!</b>

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:41.350
<b>Both armies pulled back before noon.</b>

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:43.350
<b>The dragons' chains.</b>

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:47.020
<b>They probably canceled out our dragon arts.</b>

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:48.360
<b>Canceled out?</b>

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:52.570
<b>The same happened with the 
Black Knight Roland's Durandal.</b>

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:56.450
<b>There must be some metal in this world that makes our dragon arts useless.</b>

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:01.790
<b>However, being protected from our dragon arts</b>

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:04.620
<b>may make fighting them difficult, but not impossible.</b>

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:08.500
<b>You're right.</b>

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:13.010
<b>There you have it. 
We'll take care of the dragons</b>

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:15.510
<b>while you concentrate on Thenardier.</b>

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:17.340
<b>Thanks.</b>

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:19.260
<b>Don't give us that look.</b>

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:22.460
<b>Here are two war maidens fighting side by side.</b>

00:17:22.460 --> 00:17:23.810
<b>We'll get them this time.</b>

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:29.190
<b>Now then, shall we start discussing our battle plan?</b>

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:34.780
<b>After four hours the armies are about to clash again.</b>

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:37.280
<b>The enemy's central column?</b>

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:43.290
<b>What do you think they are planning?</b>

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:46.500
<b>They should've been able to 
properly outfit their soldiers.</b>

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:48.440
<b>It is probably a smokescreen.</b>

00:17:48.440 --> 00:17:50.290
<b>They want a melee, do they?</b>

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:51.840
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:55.300
<b>By appearing weak, they want to goad us into close quarter combat,</b>

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:58.630
<b>thus keeping us from using our dragons.</b>

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:04.310
<b>We proceed as planned.</b>

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:16.570
<b>Fall back!</b>

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:19.450
<b>Hurry!</b>

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:22.370
<b>Run as fast as you can!</b>

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:31.000
<b>It's all up to you two!</b>

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:32.920
<b>Leave it to us!</b>

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.500
<b>Stay frosty!</b>

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:53.570
<b>Godspeed, Sir Mashas.</b>

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:55.230
<b>Lady Limalisha,</b>

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:58.030
<b>keep a close eye on him. 
Don't let him do anything rash.</b>

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:00.160
<b>Rest assured.</b>

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:02.570
<b>Carry as many as you can.</b>

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:05.950
<b>The young lord will have to loose a hailstorm of arrows.</b>

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:07.500
<b>Yes, I know.</b>

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:13.090
<b>After pretending to flee, 
Tigre's central column arms itself.</b>

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:21.430
<b>While the soldiers engage the left and right flanks, the two war maidens confront the dragons.</b>

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:24.510
<b>It's a one-of-a-kind all-out battle.</b>

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:26.010
<b>Slings!</b>

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:30.770
<b>Warriors throwing rocks?!</b>

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:32.400
<b>How underhan—</b>

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:49.250
<b>Shooting down even meteors: Silvrash!</b>

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:51.120
<b>Silvrash!</b>

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:55.040
<b>Silvrash! Silvrash! Silvrash!</b>

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:13.480
<b>Eleonora!</b>

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:34.540
<b>Make way!</b>

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:38.210
<b><i>It's so hard!</i></b>

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:41.880
<b>Ludmila!</b>

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:50.970
<b>That same old tactic again, right?</b>

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:54.350
<b>It just goes to show how useful it is.</b>

00:20:57.560 --> 00:20:58.730
<b>Arifar!</b>

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:05.240
<b>Cielo Zam Kafa!</b>

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:27.390
<b>Tear asunder all who stand in my path!</b>

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:29.010
<b>Ley Admos!</b>

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:55.410
<b>You passed up the perfect chance
to take out a war maiden just now.</b>

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:57.580
<b>It's hardly the time for that, is it?</b>

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:01.380
<b>The battle's as good as won.</b>

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:04.940
<b>We can leave the rest to Tigre. He'll take care of everything.</b>

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:07.690
<b>That he will.</b>

